    },
    {
      "id": "p25_b9",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330,
        270,
        910,
        290
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "假设 $\\sqrt{2}$ 是有理数。则可设"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p25_eq1",
      "kind": "equation",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "equation",
      "bbox": [
        580,
        295,
        660,
        325
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p25_b9",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": null,
        "table": null,
        "equation": {
          "latex": "\\sqrt{2}=\\frac{m}{n}",
          "fallback_text": "sqrt(2) = m/n"
        },
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p25_b10",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330,
        330,
        910,
        450
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p25_eq1",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "其中 $m$ 与 $n$ 是互素的正整数。于是 $m=\\sqrt{2}n$。两边平方，得 $m^{2}=2n^{2}$。所以，$m^{2}$ 是偶数。由例 5，知 $m$ 也是偶数。于是，可设 $m=2k$，$k$ 为正整数。将其代入 $m^{2}=2n^{2}$，得 $2n^{2}=4k^{2}$，即 $n^{2}=2k^{2}$，故 $n^{2}$ 是偶数。再根据例 5，知 $n$ 也是偶数。于是 $m$、$n$ 有公因数 2，这与 $m$、$n$ 互素的假设矛盾。"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p25_b11",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330,
        455,
        910,
        475
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "所以假设不成立，即 $\\sqrt{2}$ 是无理数。"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
